@startuml building_simples

' Recorte de prédio do módulo room, inteiro em um arquivo, no estilo simplista. Os
' diagramas completos continuam em sequencia/building/, e é lá que estão os desvios.
'
' Quatro cortes em relação a eles:
'   1. BuildingRepositoryPort e BuildingRepositoryImpl viram um participante só.
'   2. Só o caminho de sucesso. Nenhum alt: os erros (404, 422) estão nos diagramas
'      completos, e as guardas de status estão em estado/building_status.puml.
'   3. Colaborador sem regra própria vira mensagem para si mesmo.
'   4. Ativação só em trecho reto, abrindo e fechando no mesmo nível.
'
' A camada de caso de uso é uma raia só, tipada como «subsystem». Ela não representa uma
' classe: representa a camada. As classes estão em classe/simples/room/building.puml.
'
' O PATCH /buildings/{id}/status fica de fora: as transições estão em
' estado/building_status.puml.

title Prédio: criar, buscar, atualizar e remover

actor "Administrador" as Ator
boundary "Frontend" as FE
participant "BuildingController" as Ctrl

participant "<<subsystem>>\nusecases" as UC #F0FFF0

participant "Building" as Entity
participant "Repositório" as Repo
database "buildings" as DB

== POST /buildings: criar ==

Ator -> FE: preenche o formulário e confirma
activate FE
FE -> Ctrl: POST /buildings\n{name, address, totalFloors}
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> UC: execute(CreateBuildingRequest)
activate UC

UC -> Entity: Building.create(name, address, totalFloors)
activate Entity
Entity -> Entity: valida os campos\nid = UUID aleatório\nstatus = ACTIVE
Entity --> UC: Building
deactivate Entity

UC -> Repo: save(building)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO buildings
Repo --> UC: Building
deactivate Repo

UC --> Ctrl: BuildingResponse
deactivate UC
Ctrl --> FE: 201 Created {BuildingResponse}
deactivate Ctrl
FE --> Ator: exibe o resultado
deactivate FE

== GET /buildings e GET /buildings/{id}: buscar ==

Ator -> FE: abre a lista, ou um prédio
activate FE
FE -> Ctrl: GET /buildings\nou GET /buildings/{id}
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> UC: findAll() ou findById(id)
activate UC

UC -> Repo: findAll() ou findById(BuildingId.of(id))
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM buildings\nWHERE status<>'DELETED'\n[AND id=?]
DB --> Repo: List<Building> ou Optional<Building>
Repo --> UC: List<Building> ou Optional<Building>
deactivate Repo

UC --> Ctrl: BuildingResponse ou List<BuildingResponse>
deactivate UC
Ctrl --> FE: 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl
FE --> Ator: exibe o resultado
deactivate FE

== PUT /buildings/{id}: atualizar ==

Ator -> FE: edita os dados e confirma
activate FE
FE -> Ctrl: PUT /buildings/{id}\n{name, address, totalFloors}
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> UC: execute(id, UpdateBuildingRequest)
activate UC

UC -> Repo: findById(BuildingId.of(id))
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM buildings\nWHERE id=? AND status<>'DELETED'
DB --> Repo: Optional<Building>
Repo --> UC: Optional<Building>
deactivate Repo

UC -> Entity: update(name, address, totalFloors)
activate Entity
Entity -> Entity: valida os campos\nupdatedAt = now()
Entity --> UC: Building
deactivate Entity

UC -> Repo: save(building)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: UPDATE buildings SET\nname=?, address=?, total_floors=?, updated_at=?
Repo --> UC: Building
deactivate Repo

UC --> Ctrl: BuildingResponse
deactivate UC
Ctrl --> FE: 200 OK {BuildingResponse}
deactivate Ctrl
FE --> Ator: exibe o resultado
deactivate FE

== DELETE /buildings/{id}: remover ==

Ator -> FE: confirma a remoção
activate FE
FE -> Ctrl: DELETE /buildings/{id}
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> UC: execute(id)
activate UC

UC -> Repo: findById(BuildingId.of(id))
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM buildings\nWHERE id=? AND status<>'DELETED'
DB --> Repo: Optional<Building>
Repo --> UC: Optional<Building>
deactivate Repo

UC -> Entity: delete()
activate Entity
Entity -> Entity: exige status INACTIVE\nstatus = DELETED
Entity --> UC: Building
deactivate Entity

UC -> Repo: save(building)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: UPDATE buildings SET status='DELETED'
Repo --> UC: Building
deactivate Repo

UC --> Ctrl: void
deactivate UC
Ctrl --> FE: 204 No Content
deactivate Ctrl
FE --> Ator: exibe o resultado
deactivate FE

@enduml
